WEBVTT

00:01:46.186 --> 00:01:49.717
Soul Contract

00:01:50.862 --> 00:01:54.139
20th Contract

00:01:55.049 --> 00:01:58.781
Subbed by E.P. of Bayi Subs

00:02:00.600 --> 00:02:03.840
Miss Qin's determination seriously impresses me

00:02:03.840 --> 00:02:06.230
but we have a deal

00:02:06.234 --> 00:02:07.482
Old Lady

00:02:07.482 --> 00:02:09.531
The sun is rising

00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:10.780
Ma'am

00:02:12.540 --> 00:02:14.200
May the 2nd Lady

00:02:14.200 --> 00:02:16.480
be the Yangming Master

00:02:16.483 --> 00:02:20.234
May the 2nd Lady fulfill her duty

00:02:30.740 --> 00:02:32.620
I, Duanmu Siyun,

00:02:32.620 --> 00:02:34.440
will take all responsibility

00:02:34.440 --> 00:02:36.560
and will not disappoint all

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.640
2nd Lady,

00:02:37.640 --> 00:02:39.310
as you may

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:01.320
I, Yang Jinghua,

00:03:01.320 --> 00:03:03.260
am the Soul Image of Yangming Master

00:03:03.260 --> 00:03:07.020
The only Yangming Master, whom I recognize, is Duamu Xi

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.240
Anyone who objects

00:03:08.240 --> 00:03:10.870
must go through me first

00:03:10.980 --> 00:03:12.520
Duanmu Xi

00:03:12.980 --> 00:03:14.140
I'll deal with them

00:03:14.140 --> 00:03:15.900
You go find the sheath

00:03:15.900 --> 00:03:17.060
Can you handle it?

00:03:17.060 --> 00:03:18.200
Enough talk

00:03:18.200 --> 00:03:19.520
Go now

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.460
World's No. 1 Skilled?

00:03:27.140 --> 00:03:28.153
You meant

00:03:28.153 --> 00:03:30.460
The sheath is that plaque?

00:03:30.479 --> 00:03:31.360
Right

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.150
You mentioned that

00:03:33.150 --> 00:03:36.220
it's the only thing left by your parents

00:03:36.220 --> 00:03:37.220
Oh dear

00:03:37.220 --> 00:03:38.480
I forgot where I put it

00:03:38.480 --> 00:03:40.580
It should be in my room

00:03:40.580 --> 00:03:41.520
Oh Geez,

00:03:41.540 --> 00:03:42.600
where did I put?

00:03:42.600 --> 00:03:43.680
Where is it?

00:03:43.680 --> 00:03:46.790
Surely the cleaning woman didn't throw it away as rubbish!

00:03:46.792 --> 00:03:47.495
Little Xi,

00:03:47.800 --> 00:03:49.700
where did you actually go?

00:03:49.700 --> 00:03:51.400
You're still not fully recovered

00:03:51.400 --> 00:03:52.840
You made us so worry

00:03:52.840 --> 00:03:54.480
We were held up by a bug

00:03:54.480 --> 00:03:56.380
and couldn't escaped

00:03:56.649 --> 00:03:58.663
Lady of the Situ family

00:03:58.660 --> 00:04:00.440
What was going on?

00:04:02.931 --> 00:04:04.447
Li, oh Li

00:04:04.860 --> 00:04:06.620
I wasted my effort for you

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:08.750
You can't even stop one of them

00:04:08.760 --> 00:04:09.880
The demonic spirit

00:04:09.880 --> 00:04:11.580
is active again

00:04:11.580 --> 00:04:12.910
How can it be?

00:04:12.910 --> 00:04:14.800
Didn't it get purified already?

00:04:14.800 --> 00:04:18.920
The Young Master could easily handle it by lifting a mere finger

00:04:18.920 --> 00:04:20.820
Is that right?

00:04:21.200 --> 00:04:23.500
I'm still not skilled enough to purify it

00:04:23.500 --> 00:04:24.600
I asked brother Xi

00:04:24.600 --> 00:04:26.160
to handle it alone

00:04:27.920 --> 00:04:28.960
Duanmu

00:04:31.947 --> 00:04:32.960
Brother Xi

00:04:32.975 --> 00:04:35.240
What's the matter with Young Master?

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:37.710
Are you really scared?

00:04:37.710 --> 00:04:40.000
Duanmu is still in bad shape

00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:42.420
He must do as he is supposed to

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:45.040
Purifying evil spirits is his responsibility

00:04:45.040 --> 00:04:48.740
You think it's so easy to be a Yangming Master?

00:04:48.980 --> 00:04:50.000
Jinghua

00:04:54.200 --> 00:04:56.100
The sword is sealed once sheathed

00:04:56.100 --> 00:04:57.920
Unsheath then it gets unsealed

00:04:57.920 --> 00:04:59.960
Like this?

00:04:59.960 --> 00:05:01.220
Or is it like this?

00:05:01.220 --> 00:05:06.060
How the hell do I get it sheathed?

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:08.940
T-This is...?

00:05:12.740 --> 00:05:15.840
Luoye Sword is resonating

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:29.200
Oh no

00:05:29.200 --> 00:05:32.510
Is this the true form of the demonic spirit?

00:05:33.080 --> 00:05:34.640
Such great demonic power

00:05:34.640 --> 00:05:37.010
It's going to be challenging

00:05:37.380 --> 00:05:38.660
Young Master

00:05:38.660 --> 00:05:40.440
What are you waiting for?

00:05:40.440 --> 00:05:41.860
Young Master

00:05:41.870 --> 00:05:43.620
Stop pretending

00:05:45.460 --> 00:05:46.890
Little Xi

00:05:47.000 --> 00:05:49.900
I know you don't have any more power but

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:53.040
If you keep on being like this, you'll certainly die

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:01.800
How about

00:06:01.810 --> 00:06:04.260
you give up your Yangming Master position?

00:06:04.260 --> 00:06:05.950
We can help you...

00:06:07.480 --> 00:06:08.360
Who?

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:12.160
Why would a Yangming Master takes order from others?

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:15.720
You think you have rights to anyhow order a Yangming Master

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:19.920
as if the great priest of Duanmu family is your servant

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:23.620
Do you think you can afford to pay the salary of our Master Duanmu?

00:06:23.620 --> 00:06:24.680
You...

00:06:25.020 --> 00:06:26.360
Jinghua

00:06:28.990 --> 00:06:30.584
A Yangming Master

00:06:30.580 --> 00:06:32.680
has to stand between 2 realms

00:06:32.680 --> 00:06:34.920
as bearer of a billion souls' prayers

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:35.920
His power

00:06:35.920 --> 00:06:38.300
is from the World's prayers of blessings

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:41.520
It's not a tool for you to take advantage of

00:06:52.779 --> 00:06:53.622
Sifu,

00:06:53.622 --> 00:06:55.154
what's wrong?

00:06:56.100 --> 00:06:57.360
Looks like

00:06:57.360 --> 00:06:58.820
the sheath is back

00:06:58.820 --> 00:07:04.730
I'm afraid no one can escape the fate from it now

00:07:15.380 --> 00:07:16.650
What's going on?

00:07:21.861 --> 00:07:23.392
It's been years

00:07:23.392 --> 00:07:26.548
I've not seen such tremendous amount of power

00:07:52.845 --> 00:07:55.050
I thought I was a goner

00:07:58.310 --> 00:07:59.940
Calm down, Young Master

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:01.280
We have both sinned

00:08:01.280 --> 00:08:03.160
Please forgive us

00:08:04.640 --> 00:08:06.100
Hey, what's with you?

00:08:06.100 --> 00:08:08.400
Do you have to go overboard?

00:08:08.410 --> 00:08:09.210
No

00:08:09.210 --> 00:08:10.540
My ear gets too painful

00:08:10.540 --> 00:08:12.130
I can't control my power

00:08:13.760 --> 00:08:14.980
Ear painful?

00:08:14.980 --> 00:08:17.220
The amulet earring helps control my power

00:08:17.220 --> 00:08:18.520
If I lose control,

00:08:18.520 --> 00:08:20.040
it will try to suppress it

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:21.120
Holy Crap,

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:23.350
this guy is so scary

00:08:23.460 --> 00:08:25.040
Forgive me Young Master

00:08:25.040 --> 00:08:30.140
Please listen to my explanation.  It was a grave misunderstanding

00:08:30.140 --> 00:08:31.020
2nd Sister,

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:33.530
admits her defeat

00:08:33.640 --> 00:08:34.820
Since then,

00:08:34.820 --> 00:08:38.200
the Old Lady decided to give the Situ family a serious punishment

00:08:38.200 --> 00:08:40.780
Uh, what was the punishment?

00:08:40.780 --> 00:08:42.480
I wasn't quite sure either

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.280
'coz at that moment...

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:45.580
Come with me to my room

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:47.930
Hey

00:08:47.930 --> 00:08:49.120
Are you alright?

00:08:49.120 --> 00:08:50.300
Should I call a doctor?

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:51.510
No need

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:53.460
Siming will come over to help out

00:08:53.460 --> 00:08:55.080
Siming is not even a doctor

00:08:55.080 --> 00:08:56.100
Listen to me

00:08:56.120 --> 00:08:58.180
If you're sick, you should go to hospital

00:08:58.180 --> 00:08:59.600
If anything bad happens,

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:02.020
you will have to spend the rest of your life...

00:09:03.840 --> 00:09:05.280
What are you trying to do?!

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.330
Don't move

00:09:06.332 --> 00:09:07.986
It won't take long

00:09:12.938 --> 00:09:15.357
W-W-What did you do to me?

00:09:17.120 --> 00:09:19.040
My strength is restoring

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:19.720
Sorry,

00:09:19.720 --> 00:09:21.550
I caused you injury,

00:09:21.550 --> 00:09:23.380
but you also stabbed me before

00:09:23.380 --> 00:09:25.100
I guess we're even

00:09:25.104 --> 00:09:26.511
What even?

00:09:29.620 --> 00:09:31.240
He fell sleep?

00:09:31.740 --> 00:09:33.140
Help me!

00:09:33.140 --> 00:09:34.660
A man flattening a ghost!

00:09:38.120 --> 00:09:39.300
Q-Q-Q-Q-Q-

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.740
Qin Siyao

00:09:40.750 --> 00:09:42.520
Yang Jinghua

00:09:42.523 --> 00:09:45.614
What are you trying to do to my man?!

00:09:46.440 --> 00:09:48.240
It's not what you think!

00:09:48.240 --> 00:09:49.820
I can explain!

00:09:49.820 --> 00:09:51.120
You don't have to explain!

00:09:51.120 --> 00:09:51.860
Bastard!

00:09:51.860 --> 00:09:53.240
Go to hell!

00:09:53.241 --> 00:09:56.522
I'm already dead!!!

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:02.980
Still thinking about the incident?

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:05.750
It's time to let go

00:10:06.220 --> 00:10:07.160
No

00:10:07.160 --> 00:10:09.460
This time, we underestimated our enemy

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:11.720
That Soul Image may look like a fool

00:10:11.720 --> 00:10:13.760
but he's the descendant of Yangning

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:15.860
There won't be a next time

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.630
Yang Jinghua

00:10:17.631 --> 00:10:19.179
I would like to see

00:10:19.179 --> 00:10:21.069
what else you're capable of

00:10:21.460 --> 00:10:23.040
My capability

00:10:23.040 --> 00:10:24.880
is having secret special moves

00:10:24.880 --> 00:10:26.480
but whoever sees that moves

00:10:26.480 --> 00:10:28.310
is all dead now

00:10:31.020 --> 00:10:31.720
I hit

00:10:31.720 --> 00:10:32.880
hit, hit, hit, hit

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:35.100
829th style 10-hits

00:10:35.100 --> 00:10:36.100
Yeah!

00:10:36.105 --> 00:10:37.948
39 rounds all win

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:39.720
What crazy moves are those?

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.860
And what's with the sucky names?

00:10:41.860 --> 00:10:45.850
It feels awesome to play the games with my own hands

00:10:46.080 --> 00:10:49.400
Is this how you intend to use your power that's given by Duanmu?

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.160
Duanmu

00:10:50.160 --> 00:10:52.460
Where are you going with the getup?

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.020
I want to go too

00:10:54.030 --> 00:10:55.850
You guys don't follow

00:10:57.240 --> 00:10:58.480
I'm Yang Jinghua

00:10:58.480 --> 00:11:00.220
My parents passed away when I was young

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:01.820
and I've depleted my family fortunes

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:03.760
No car, no house, no job

00:11:03.760 --> 00:11:06.080
Even my life is thrown away

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.310
This handsome boy

00:11:07.310 --> 00:11:08.480
is Duanmu Xi

00:11:08.480 --> 00:11:10.460
After I died, I decided to follow him

00:11:10.460 --> 00:11:11.470
This guy

00:11:11.470 --> 00:11:13.440
can be quite unaccommodating

00:11:13.440 --> 00:11:16.120
He even avoided me for the past 2 days

00:11:16.120 --> 00:11:18.570
Although, there're many things I do not know,

00:11:18.576 --> 00:11:20.354
but there's ample time ahead

00:11:20.354 --> 00:11:21.854
When the time comes,

00:11:21.850 --> 00:11:24.080
everything will likely be sorted out

00:11:25.514 --> 00:11:27.525
It's such a great day today

00:11:28.560 --> 00:11:29.750
Recently,

00:11:29.759 --> 00:11:32.128
I met someone

00:11:32.128 --> 00:11:34.541
He always caught me by surprise

00:11:34.541 --> 00:11:36.948
In one moment, he'd cause trouble

00:11:36.940 --> 00:11:39.060
then he'd be dependable in next moment

00:11:39.060 --> 00:11:40.790
Did you know

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:43.025
he even said he wanted to protect me?

00:11:43.260 --> 00:11:48.998
I thought no one else would say such a thing besides you

00:11:50.640 --> 00:11:53.600
He actually said he wanted to protect me

00:11:55.040 --> 00:11:58.650
I don't dare to let him know what I did

00:11:59.760 --> 00:12:03.730
He will soon find out one day

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:05.210
By then,

00:12:05.219 --> 00:12:07.985
he will never forgive me

00:12:07.980 --> 00:12:09.060
Zicheng,

00:12:09.062 --> 00:12:11.624
when we made that promise,

00:12:11.620 --> 00:12:15.550
have you thought about the consequences that are happening now?

00:12:16.060 --> 00:12:17.280
Zicheng

00:12:32.400 --> 00:12:33.520
Tell me

00:12:33.520 --> 00:12:35.200
if this is fated

00:12:35.208 --> 00:12:37.344
or against fate?

00:12:43.720 --> 00:12:46.570
I transgressed over thousands of years

00:12:46.577 --> 00:12:48.906
I wonder if I can still

00:12:49.173 --> 00:12:52.973
place an ending till this day?
